    "reviews": "\u201cIt\u2019s one of those unassuming games that comes out of nowhere and blows your socks off, keeping you glued to your seat until you\u2019ve finished it; a chunk of exhilarating arcade gaming action that\u2019s not to be missed.\u201d<br>9 \u2013 GameSpew<br><br>\u201cPulse-pounding gunplay, endless challenge modes, and fun Twitch chat integration will ensure that fans will have plenty of reasons to keep shooting\u201d<br>8.5 \u2013 TechRaptor<br><br>\u201cSoundtrack kicks so hard it knocked my TV over\u201d<br>8.2 \u2013 The Inner Circle<br>",
